854	ADD-0050	偏亞硫酸氫鈉	Sodium Metabisulfite	["\\u7126\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9209"]	INS 223	["\\u6297\\u6c27\\u5316\\u5291"]	偏亞硫酸氫鈉是一種常用於防褐變與防霉的食品抗氧化劑。它廣泛添加於蜜餞、脫水蔬菜、金針乾、果醬及各式糕餅中。在各國政府規定的安全限量內，正常膳食攝取此成分對人體是安全且無害的。不過，此成分會產生二氧化硫，對亞硫酸鹽過敏的消費者或氣喘患者在購買食用前應多留意標示。	使用範圍及限量: 1.本品可使用於麥芽飲料（不含酒精）；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.03 g/kg以下。\n\n2.本品可使用於果醬、果凍、果皮凍及水果派餡；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.1 g/kg以下。\n\n3.本品可使用於表面裝飾用途（薄煎餅之糖漿、奶昔及冰淇淋等產品之調味糖漿）；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.04 g/kg以下。\n\n4.本品可使用於含葡萄糖糖漿之糕餅；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.05 g/kg以下。\n使用限制: 限於食品製造或加工必須時使用。	unknown	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	[{"group": "\\u6c23\\u5598\\u60a3\\u8005", "concern": "avoid", "confidence": "research_supported", "source_type": "pubmed", "source_title": "Adverse reactions to the sulphite additives - PMC - NIH", "source_url": "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4017440", "source_year": 1998, "ai_reasoning": "\\u6587\\u737b\\u6307\\u51fa\\uff0c\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9e7d\\u7684\\u66b4\\u9732\\u4e3b\\u8981\\u6e90\\u65bc\\u98df\\u7528\\u542b\\u6709\\u9019\\u4e9b\\u6dfb\\u52a0\\u7269\\u7684\\u98df\\u54c1\\u548c\\u98f2\\u6599\\u3002\\u7814\\u7a76\\u986f\\u793a\\uff0c\\u7d04\\u67093%\\u81f310%\\u7684\\u6c23\\u5598\\u60a3\\u8005\\u5728\\u53e3\\u670d\\u651d\\u5165\\u9019\\u4e9b\\u6dfb\\u52a0\\u7269\\u5f8c\\u6703\\u5f15\\u767c\\u654f\\u611f\\u53cd\\u61c9\\u3002\\u5efa\\u8b70\\u6c23\\u5598\\u60a3\\u8005\\u61c9\\u907f\\u514d\\u98df\\u7528\\u542b\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9e7d\\u4e4b\\u98df\\u54c1\\u3002", "reviewed_by_human": false, "source_quote": "Exposure to the sulphites arises mainly from the consumption of foods and drinks that contain these additives; however exposure may also occur through the use of pharmaceutical products, as well as in occupational settings. Most studies report a prevalence of sulphite sensitivity of 3 to 10% among asthmatic subjects who ingest these additives."}, {"group": "\\u904e\\u654f\\u9ad4\\u8cea\\u8005", "concern": "caution", "confidence": "research_supported", "source_type": "pubmed", "source_title": "[PDF] Follow-up of the re-evaluation of sulfur dioxide (E 220) - EFSA", "source_url": "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4017440", "source_year": "2009", "ai_reasoning": "\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9e7d\\u662f\\u5e38\\u898b\\u7684\\u98df\\u7269\\u904e\\u654f\\u539f\\u3002\\u904e\\u654f\\u9ad4\\u8cea\\u8005\\u53e3\\u670d\\u651d\\u53d6\\u504f\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u6c2b\\u9209\\u5f8c\\uff0c\\u53ef\\u80fd\\u5f15\\u767c\\u8541\\u9ebb\\u75b9\\u3001\\u76ae\\u819a\\u6f6e\\u7d05\\u3001\\u80c3\\u8178\\u9053\\u4e0d\\u9069\\u6216\\u904e\\u654f\\u6027\\u4f11\\u514b\\u7b49\\u56b4\\u91cd\\u904e\\u654f\\u53cd\\u61c9\\u3002\\u5efa\\u8b70\\u654f\\u611f\\u500b\\u9ad4\\u907f\\u514d\\u98df\\u7528\\u542b\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9e7d\\u7684\\u98df\\u54c1\\u3002", "reviewed_by_human": false, "source_quote": "One of the earliest reports suggesting that ingestion of sulphites could cause irritation of the respiratory tract was published in 1973 (5). Since then numerous case reports and reviews have been published on the phenomenon of respiratory hypersensitivity to ingested sulphites. The first case of anaphylaxis following ingestion of sodium metabisulphite in a restaurant salad was reported in 1976 (6), and the following year SO2 in orange drinks was reported to induce asthma (15)."}]	允許使用	verified	["https://www.inchem.org/documents/jecfa/jeceval/jec_2159.htm", "https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/656671", "https://www.inchem.org/documents/jecfa/jecmono/40abcj16.htm"]
855	ADD-0051	α– 醣基異槲皮苷	α– Glycosyl–isoquercitrin	[]	\N	["\\u6297\\u6c27\\u5316\\u5291"]	α-醣基異槲皮苷是一種由天然植物成分製成的抗氧化劑。它常見於飲料、蔬果汁、果凍和糖果等，主要用來防止食品氧化變質並保持色澤。美國食品藥物管理局及台灣官方均核准其使用，相關安全評估指出其毒性極低，在法規限量範圍內正常飲食攝取，對人體健康無害。	使用範圍及限量: 1. 本品可用於飲料、蔬果汁、冷凍乳製品、動物膠、布丁、果醬、果凍、糖果、糕餅、湯粉及罐裝湯品，用量為150 mg/kg以下。\n\n2. 本品可用於口香糖，用量為1500 mg/kg以下。	unknown	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	[]	允許使用	verified	["https://www.fda.gov"]
856	ADD-0052	迷迭香萃取物	Extracts of Rosemary	[]	INS 392	["\\u6297\\u6c27\\u5316\\u5291"]	迷迭香萃取物是從植物中提取的天然食品抗氧化劑，廣泛用於防止肉製品及油脂氧化酸敗。安全評估指出其主要活性成分在動物與人體試驗中均表現出極高的安全性，無遺傳毒性或致癌疑慮。在法規核准的劑量下，日常正常膳食攝取對健康安全無害，可作為安心的天然選擇。	使用範圍及限量: 1.本品可用於堅果醬、加工堅果、烘焙製品、調味料及調味醬，用量以鼠尾草酸(carnosic acid)及鼠尾草酚(carnosol)總量計 200 mg/kg 以下(以油脂含量計)。\n2.本品可用於口香糖及泡泡糖、加工蛋製品、仿魚卵製品、脫水馬鈴薯，用量以鼠尾草酸(carnosic acid)及鼠尾草酚(carnosol)總量計 200 mg/kg 以下。\n3.本品可用於油脂含量10%以上之水產製品、油脂含量10%以上肉製品(排除乾製香腸)、脫水肉品，用量以鼠尾草酸及鼠尾草酚總量計 150 mg/kg 以下(以油脂含量計)。\n4.本品可用於乾製香腸、人造奶油及油脂抹醬，用量以鼠尾草酸及鼠尾草酚總量計 100 mg/kg 以下(以油脂含量計)。\n5.本品可用於食用油脂(排除初榨油、橄欖油及橄欖粕油)、植物性烤盤油，以及以馬鈴薯、穀類及澱粉製之零食，用量以鼠尾草酸及鼠尾草酚總量計 50 mg/kg 以下(以油脂含量計)。\n6.本品可用於湯品，用量以鼠尾草酸及鼠尾草酚總量計 50 mg/kg 以下。\n7.本品可用於供冰淇淋產製之乳粉，用量以鼠尾草酸及鼠尾草酚總量計 30 mg/kg 以下(以油脂含量計)。\n8.本品可用於3歲以上族群之膠囊、錠狀、粉狀及液態膳食補充品，用量以鼠尾草酸及鼠尾草酚總量計400 mg/kg以下。\n9.本品可用於油脂含量10%以下之水產製品、油脂含量10%以下肉製品(排除乾製香腸)，用量以鼠尾草酸及鼠尾草酚總量計 15 mg/kg 以下(以油脂含量計)。\n10.本品可用於麵食類製品之餡料，用量以鼠尾草酸及鼠尾草酚總量計 250 mg/kg 以下(以油脂含量計)。\n使用限制: 限於食品製造或加工必須時使用。	unknown	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	[]	允許使用	verified	["https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/drugsatfda_docs/nda/2019/210895Orig1s000PharmR.pdf", "https://cdn.who.int/media/docs/default-source/food-safety/jecfa/summary-and-conclusions/jecfa-100-summary-report-copy_v1.pdf?sfvrsn=3ef0c6a7_4", "https://www.who.int/publications/i/item/9789240118003"]
858	ADD-0054	亞硫酸鈉	Sodium Sulfite	["\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9209\\u9e7d"]	INS 221	["\\u6f02\\u767d\\u5291"]	亞硫酸鈉是一種常用於防止食品褐變與漂白的添加物。它廣泛添加於金針乾、杏乾、葡萄乾、脫水蔬菜及食用樹薯澱粉中。進入人體後，能快速被代謝為無損健康的硫酸鹽排出。國際安全機構與官方評估確認，在限量標準內膳食攝取十分安全。但過敏體質者與氣喘患者需多注意標示，適量食用。	使用範圍及限量: 1.本品可使用於金針乾製品；用量以SO2殘留量計為4.0g/kg以下。 \n2.本品可用於杏乾；用量以SO2殘留量計為2.0 g/kg以下。 \n3.本品可使用於白葡萄乾；用量以SO2殘留量計為1.5 g/kg以下。 \n4.本品可使用於動物膠、脫水蔬菜及其他脫水水果；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.50 g/kg以下。 \n5.本品可使用於糖蜜及糖飴；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.30 g/kg以下。\n6.本品可使用於食用樹薯澱粉；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.15 g/kg以下。\n7.本品可使用於糖漬果實類、蝦類及貝類；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.10 g/kg以下。 \n8.本品可使用於蒟蒻：非直接供食用之蒟蒻原料，用量以SO2殘留量計為0.90 g/kg以下；直接供食用之蒟蒻製品，用量以SO2殘留量計為0.030 g/kg以下。\n9.本品可使用於上述食品以外之其他加工食品；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.030 g/kg以下。但飲料（不包括果汁）、麵粉及其製品（不包括烘焙食品）不得使用。	unknown	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	[{"group": "\\u6c23\\u5598\\u60a3\\u8005", "concern": "avoid", "confidence": "research_supported", "source_type": "pubmed", "source_title": "Adverse reactions to the sulphite additives - PMC - NIH", "source_url": "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4017440", "source_year": 1998, "ai_reasoning": "\\u6587\\u737b\\u6307\\u51fa\\uff0c\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9e7d\\u7684\\u66b4\\u9732\\u4e3b\\u8981\\u6e90\\u65bc\\u98df\\u7528\\u542b\\u6709\\u9019\\u4e9b\\u6dfb\\u52a0\\u7269\\u7684\\u98df\\u54c1\\u548c\\u98f2\\u6599\\u3002\\u7814\\u7a76\\u986f\\u793a\\uff0c\\u7d04\\u67093%\\u81f310%\\u7684\\u6c23\\u5598\\u60a3\\u8005\\u5728\\u53e3\\u670d\\u651d\\u5165\\u9019\\u4e9b\\u6dfb\\u52a0\\u7269\\u5f8c\\u6703\\u5f15\\u767c\\u654f\\u611f\\u53cd\\u61c9\\u3002\\u5efa\\u8b70\\u6c23\\u5598\\u60a3\\u8005\\u61c9\\u907f\\u514d\\u98df\\u7528\\u542b\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9e7d\\u4e4b\\u98df\\u54c1\\u3002", "reviewed_by_human": false, "source_quote": "Exposure to the sulphites arises mainly from the consumption of foods and drinks that contain these additives; however exposure may also occur through the use of pharmaceutical products, as well as in occupational settings. Most studies report a prevalence of sulphite sensitivity of 3 to 10% among asthmatic subjects who ingest these additives."}, {"group": "\\u904e\\u654f\\u9ad4\\u8cea\\u8005", "concern": "caution", "confidence": "research_supported", "source_type": "pubmed", "source_title": "Safety risks associated with sulfite-containing compounded drugs", "source_url": "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4017440", "source_year": "", "ai_reasoning": "\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9e7d\\u662f\\u5e38\\u898b\\u7684\\u98df\\u7269\\u904e\\u654f\\u539f\\u3002\\u904e\\u654f\\u9ad4\\u8cea\\u8005\\u53e3\\u670d\\u651d\\u53d6\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9209\\u5f8c\\uff0c\\u53ef\\u80fd\\u5f15\\u767c\\u8541\\u9ebb\\u75b9\\u3001\\u76ae\\u819a\\u6f6e\\u7d05\\u3001\\u80c3\\u8178\\u9053\\u4e0d\\u9069\\u6216\\u904e\\u654f\\u6027\\u4f11\\u514b\\u7b49\\u56b4\\u91cd\\u904e\\u654f\\u53cd\\u61c9\\u3002\\u5efa\\u8b70\\u654f\\u611f\\u500b\\u9ad4\\u907f\\u514d\\u98df\\u7528\\u542b\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9e7d\\u7684\\u98df\\u54c1\\u3002", "reviewed_by_human": false, "source_quote": "to hyperresponsiveness to SO2 gas, sulphite sensitivity predominantly refers to the triggering of adverse symptoms following ingestion, or parenteral or topical exposure to these additives. While sensitivity to the sulphites can present in a number of ways, it is the triggering of adverse respiratory symptoms (predominantly amongst asthmatics) that seems to occur most frequently. It has been estimated that 3\\u201310% of asthmatics experience such symptoms (7, 18, 19)."}]	允許使用	verified	["https://www.inchem.org/documents/jecfa/jeceval/jec_2176.htm", "https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/24437", "https://www.inchem.org/documents/jecfa/jecmono/40abcj16.htm"]
859	ADD-0055	亞硫酸鈉（無水）	Sodium Sulfite（Anhydrous）	[]	INS 221	["\\u6f02\\u767d\\u5291"]	亞硫酸鈉（無水）是一種常作防腐、漂白與防變色用途的添加物。它主要添加於脫水蔬果、金針、糖蜜和糕餅中。在符合國家規定的限量標準內，正常飲食攝取此成分對人體健康沒有危害。不過，由於它可能誘發敏感族群（如氣喘患者）的過敏反應，此類人群在食用相關食品時需特別留意。	使用範圍及限量: 1.本品可使用於金針乾製品；用量以SO2殘留量計為4.0g/kg以下。 \n2.本品可用於杏乾；用量以SO2殘留量計為2.0 g/kg以下。 \n3.本品可使用於白葡萄乾；用量以SO2殘留量計為1.5 g/kg以下。 \n4.本品可使用於動物膠、脫水蔬菜及其他脫水水果；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.50 g/kg以下。 \n5.本品可使用於糖蜜及糖飴；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.30 g/kg以下。\n6.本品可使用於食用樹薯澱粉；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.15 g/kg以下。\n7.本品可使用於糖漬果實類、蝦類及貝類；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.10 g/kg以下。 \n8.本品可使用於蒟蒻：非直接供食用之蒟蒻原料，用量以SO2殘留量計為0.90 g/kg以下；直接供食用之蒟蒻製品，用量以SO2殘留量計為0.030 g/kg以下。\n9.本品可使用於上述食品以外之其他加工食品；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.030 g/kg以下。但飲料（不包括果汁）、麵粉及其製品（不包括烘焙食品）不得使用。	unknown	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	[{"group": "\\u6c23\\u5598\\u60a3\\u8005", "concern": "avoid", "confidence": "research_supported", "source_type": "pubmed", "source_title": "Adverse reactions to the sulphite additives - PMC - NIH", "source_url": "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4017440", "source_year": 1998, "ai_reasoning": "\\u6587\\u737b\\u6307\\u51fa\\uff0c\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9e7d\\u7684\\u66b4\\u9732\\u4e3b\\u8981\\u6e90\\u65bc\\u98df\\u7528\\u542b\\u6709\\u9019\\u4e9b\\u6dfb\\u52a0\\u7269\\u7684\\u98df\\u54c1\\u548c\\u98f2\\u6599\\u3002\\u7814\\u7a76\\u986f\\u793a\\uff0c\\u7d04\\u67093%\\u81f310%\\u7684\\u6c23\\u5598\\u60a3\\u8005\\u5728\\u53e3\\u670d\\u651d\\u5165\\u9019\\u4e9b\\u6dfb\\u52a0\\u7269\\u5f8c\\u6703\\u5f15\\u767c\\u654f\\u611f\\u53cd\\u61c9\\u3002\\u5efa\\u8b70\\u6c23\\u5598\\u60a3\\u8005\\u61c9\\u907f\\u514d\\u98df\\u7528\\u542b\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9e7d\\u4e4b\\u98df\\u54c1\\u3002", "reviewed_by_human": false, "source_quote": "Exposure to the sulphites arises mainly from the consumption of foods and drinks that contain these additives; however exposure may also occur through the use of pharmaceutical products, as well as in occupational settings. Most studies report a prevalence of sulphite sensitivity of 3 to 10% among asthmatic subjects who ingest these additives."}, {"group": "\\u904e\\u654f\\u9ad4\\u8cea\\u8005", "concern": "caution", "confidence": "research_supported", "source_type": "pubmed", "source_title": "[PDF] Follow-up of the re-evaluation of sulfur dioxide (E 220) - EFSA", "source_url": "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4017440", "source_year": "2009", "ai_reasoning": "\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9e7d\\u662f\\u5e38\\u898b\\u7684\\u98df\\u7269\\u904e\\u654f\\u539f\\u3002\\u904e\\u654f\\u9ad4\\u8cea\\u8005\\u53e3\\u670d\\u651d\\u53d6\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9209\\uff08\\u7121\\u6c34\\uff09\\u5f8c\\uff0c\\u53ef\\u80fd\\u5f15\\u767c\\u8541\\u9ebb\\u75b9\\u3001\\u76ae\\u819a\\u6f6e\\u7d05\\u3001\\u80c3\\u8178\\u9053\\u4e0d\\u9069\\u6216\\u904e\\u654f\\u6027\\u4f11\\u514b\\u7b49\\u56b4\\u91cd\\u904e\\u654f\\u53cd\\u61c9\\u3002\\u5efa\\u8b70\\u654f\\u611f\\u500b\\u9ad4\\u907f\\u514d\\u98df\\u7528\\u542b\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9e7d\\u7684\\u98df\\u54c1\\u3002", "reviewed_by_human": false, "source_quote": "to hyperresponsiveness to SO2 gas, sulphite sensitivity predominantly refers to the triggering of adverse symptoms following ingestion, or parenteral or topical exposure to these additives. While sensitivity to the sulphites can present in a number of ways, it is the triggering of adverse respiratory symptoms (predominantly amongst asthmatics) that seems to occur most frequently. It has been estimated that 3\\u201310% of asthmatics experience such symptoms (7, 18, 19)."}]	允許使用	verified	["https://www.inchem.org/documents/jecfa/jeceval/jec_2176.htm", "https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/24437", "https://www.inchem.org/documents/jecfa/jecmono/40abcj16.htm"]
860	ADD-0056	亞硫酸氫鈉	Sodium Bisulfite	["\\u91cd\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9209"]	INS 222	["\\u6f02\\u767d\\u5291"]	亞硫酸氫鈉是一種常用於漂白與保鮮的亞硫酸鹽類添加物。它常見於金針乾、杏乾、白葡萄乾、脫水蔬菜與澱粉中。此成分經評估在一般合規限額下對人體安全。但因其在加工中會釋放出二氧化硫，對亞硫酸鹽過敏者或氣喘病史患者食用後可能引發身體不適，建議此類特殊群體應多注意。	使用範圍及限量: 1.本品可使用於金針乾製品；用量以SO2殘留量計為4.0g/kg以下。 \n2.本品可用於杏乾；用量以SO2殘留量計為2.0 g/kg以下。 \n3.本品可使用於白葡萄乾；用量以SO2殘留量計為1.5 g/kg以下。 \n4.本品可使用於動物膠、脫水蔬菜及其他脫水水果；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.50 g/kg以下。 \n5.本品可使用於糖蜜及糖飴；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.30 g/kg以下。\n6.本品可使用於食用樹薯澱粉；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.15 g/kg以下。\n7.本品可使用於糖漬果實類、蝦類及貝類；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.10 g/kg以下。 \n8.本品可使用於蒟蒻：非直接供食用之蒟蒻原料，用量以SO2殘留量計為0.90 g/kg以下；直接供食用之蒟蒻製品，用量以SO2殘留量計為0.030 g/kg以下。\n9.本品可使用於上述食品以外之其他加工食品；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.030 g/kg以下。但飲料（不包括果汁）、麵粉及其製品（不包括烘焙食品）不得使用。	unknown	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	[{"group": "\\u6c23\\u5598\\u60a3\\u8005", "concern": "avoid", "confidence": "verified", "source_type": "none", "source_title": "", "source_url": "", "source_year": null, "ai_reasoning": "\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9e7d\\u5728\\u98df\\u7269\\u4e2d\\u6703\\u91cb\\u653e\\u4e8c\\u6c27\\u5316\\u786b\\uff0c\\u6c23\\u5598\\u60a3\\u8005\\u651d\\u53d6\\u5f8c\\u53ef\\u80fd\\u8a98\\u767c\\u6025\\u6027\\u6c23\\u5598\\u767c\\u4f5c\\u6216\\u547c\\u5438\\u56f0\\u96e3\\u3002", "reviewed_by_human": false}, {"group": "\\u904e\\u654f\\u9ad4\\u8cea\\u8005", "concern": "caution", "confidence": "research_supported", "source_type": "pubmed", "source_title": "Hazard Analysis and Risk-Based Preventive Controls for Human Food", "source_url": "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4017440", "source_year": "2016", "ai_reasoning": "\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9e7d\\u662f\\u5e38\\u898b\\u7684\\u98df\\u7269\\u904e\\u654f\\u539f\\u3002\\u904e\\u654f\\u9ad4\\u8cea\\u8005\\u53e3\\u670d\\u651d\\u53d6\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u6c2b\\u9209\\u5f8c\\uff0c\\u53ef\\u80fd\\u5f15\\u767c\\u8541\\u9ebb\\u75b9\\u3001\\u76ae\\u819a\\u6f6e\\u7d05\\u3001\\u80c3\\u8178\\u9053\\u4e0d\\u9069\\u6216\\u904e\\u654f\\u6027\\u4f11\\u514b\\u7b49\\u56b4\\u91cd\\u904e\\u654f\\u53cd\\u61c9\\u3002\\u5efa\\u8b70\\u654f\\u611f\\u500b\\u9ad4\\u907f\\u514d\\u98df\\u7528\\u542b\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9e7d\\u7684\\u98df\\u54c1\\u3002", "reviewed_by_human": false, "source_quote": "sulphite sensitivity predominantly refers to the triggering of adverse symptoms following ingestion, or parenteral or topical exposure to these additives. While sensitivity to the sulphites can present in a number of ways, it is the triggering of adverse respiratory symptoms (predominantly amongst asthmatics) that seems to occur most frequently. It has been estimated that 3-10% of asthmatics experience such symptoms."}]	允許使用	research_supported	["https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/23665763"]
861	ADD-0057	低亞硫酸鈉	Sodium Hydrosulfite	["\\u4fdd\\u96aa\\u7c89", "\\u9023\\u4e8c\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9209"]	\N	["\\u6f02\\u767d\\u5291"]	低亞硫酸鈉（俗稱保險粉）是一種強效的食品漂白劑與抗氧化劑。它常見於金針乾、杏乾、葡萄乾、脫水蔬菜及食用樹薯澱粉中。雖然漂白效果顯著，但法規嚴格規定殘留限量。在合法安全限量內，正常膳食對人體是安全無害的，但對亞硫酸鹽過敏的人或氣喘患者在挑選食用時需多加注意。	使用範圍及限量: 1.本品可使用於金針乾製品；用量以SO2殘留量計為4.0g/kg以下。 \n2.本品可用於杏乾；用量以SO2殘留量計為2.0 g/kg以下。 \n3.本品可使用於白葡萄乾；用量以SO2殘留量計為1.5 g/kg以下。 \n4.本品可使用於動物膠、脫水蔬菜及其他脫水水果；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.50 g/kg以下。 \n5.本品可使用於糖蜜及糖飴；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.30 g/kg以下。\n6.本品可使用於食用樹薯澱粉；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.15 g/kg以下。\n7.本品可使用於糖漬果實類、蝦類及貝類；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.10 g/kg以下。 \n8.本品可使用於蒟蒻：非直接供食用之蒟蒻原料，用量以SO2殘留量計為0.90 g/kg以下；直接供食用之蒟蒻製品，用量以SO2殘留量計為0.030 g/kg以下。\n9.本品可使用於上述食品以外之其他加工食品；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.030 g/kg以下。但飲料（不包括果汁）、麵粉及其製品（不包括烘焙食品）不得使用。	unknown	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	[{"group": "\\u6c23\\u5598\\u60a3\\u8005", "concern": "avoid", "confidence": "verified", "source_type": "none", "source_title": "", "source_url": "", "source_year": null, "ai_reasoning": "\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9e7d\\u5728\\u98df\\u7269\\u4e2d\\u6703\\u91cb\\u653e\\u4e8c\\u6c27\\u5316\\u786b\\uff0c\\u6c23\\u5598\\u60a3\\u8005\\u651d\\u53d6\\u5f8c\\u53ef\\u80fd\\u8a98\\u767c\\u6025\\u6027\\u6c23\\u5598\\u767c\\u4f5c\\u6216\\u547c\\u5438\\u56f0\\u96e3\\u3002", "reviewed_by_human": false}]	允許使用	research_supported	["https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/24489"]
862	ADD-0058	偏亞硫酸氫鉀	Potassium Metabisulfite	[]	INS 224	["\\u6f02\\u767d\\u5291"]	偏亞硫酸氫鉀是一種主要用於水果乾及脫水蔬菜的漂白劑與防腐劑。它常添加於金針乾、杏乾、葡萄乾及各式糕餅中，用以抑制褐變、保持食材色澤。在安全限額標準下，日常飲食攝取極為安全。但因為會釋放微量二氧化硫，對亞硫酸鹽過敏或患有氣喘的消費者，應特別留意包裝標示。	使用範圍及限量: 1.本品可使用於金針乾製品；用量以SO2殘留量計為4.0g/kg以下。 \n2.本品可用於杏乾；用量以SO2殘留量計為2.0 g/kg以下。 \n3.本品可使用於白葡萄乾；用量以SO2殘留量計為1.5 g/kg以下。 \n4.本品可使用於動物膠、脫水蔬菜及其他脫水水果；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.50 g/kg以下。 \n5.本品可使用於糖蜜及糖飴；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.30 g/kg以下。\n6.本品可使用於食用樹薯澱粉；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.15 g/kg以下。\n7.本品可使用於糖漬果實類、蝦類及貝類；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.10 g/kg以下。 \n8.本品可使用於蒟蒻：非直接供食用之蒟蒻原料，用量以SO2殘留量計為0.90 g/kg以下；直接供食用之蒟蒻製品，用量以SO2殘留量計為0.030 g/kg以下。\n9.本品可使用於上述食品以外之其他加工食品；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.030 g/kg以下。但飲料（不包括果汁）、麵粉及其製品（不包括烘焙食品）不得使用。	unknown	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	[{"group": "\\u6c23\\u5598\\u60a3\\u8005", "concern": "avoid", "confidence": "research_supported", "source_type": "pubmed", "source_title": "Adverse reactions to the sulphite additives - PMC - NIH", "source_url": "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4017440", "source_year": 1998, "ai_reasoning": "\\u6587\\u737b\\u6307\\u51fa\\uff0c\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9e7d\\u7684\\u66b4\\u9732\\u4e3b\\u8981\\u6e90\\u65bc\\u98df\\u7528\\u542b\\u6709\\u9019\\u4e9b\\u6dfb\\u52a0\\u7269\\u7684\\u98df\\u54c1\\u548c\\u98f2\\u6599\\u3002\\u7814\\u7a76\\u986f\\u793a\\uff0c\\u7d04\\u67093%\\u81f310%\\u7684\\u6c23\\u5598\\u60a3\\u8005\\u5728\\u53e3\\u670d\\u651d\\u5165\\u9019\\u4e9b\\u6dfb\\u52a0\\u7269\\u5f8c\\u6703\\u5f15\\u767c\\u654f\\u611f\\u53cd\\u61c9\\u3002\\u5efa\\u8b70\\u6c23\\u5598\\u60a3\\u8005\\u61c9\\u907f\\u514d\\u98df\\u7528\\u542b\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9e7d\\u4e4b\\u98df\\u54c1\\u3002", "reviewed_by_human": false, "source_quote": "Exposure to the sulphites arises mainly from the consumption of foods and drinks that contain these additives; however exposure may also occur through the use of pharmaceutical products, as well as in occupational settings. Most studies report a prevalence of sulphite sensitivity of 3 to 10% among asthmatic subjects who ingest these additives."}, {"group": "\\u904e\\u654f\\u9ad4\\u8cea\\u8005", "concern": "caution", "confidence": "research_supported", "source_type": "pubmed", "source_title": "[PDF] Follow-up of the re-evaluation of sulfur dioxide (E 220) - EFSA", "source_url": "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4017440", "source_year": "2009", "ai_reasoning": "\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9e7d\\u662f\\u5e38\\u898b\\u7684\\u98df\\u7269\\u904e\\u654f\\u539f\\u3002\\u904e\\u654f\\u9ad4\\u8cea\\u8005\\u53e3\\u670d\\u651d\\u53d6\\u504f\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u6c2b\\u9240\\u5f8c\\uff0c\\u53ef\\u80fd\\u5f15\\u767c\\u8541\\u9ebb\\u75b9\\u3001\\u76ae\\u819a\\u6f6e\\u7d05\\u3001\\u80c3\\u8178\\u9053\\u4e0d\\u9069\\u6216\\u904e\\u654f\\u6027\\u4f11\\u514b\\u7b49\\u56b4\\u91cd\\u904e\\u654f\\u53cd\\u61c9\\u3002\\u5efa\\u8b70\\u654f\\u611f\\u500b\\u9ad4\\u907f\\u514d\\u98df\\u7528\\u542b\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9e7d\\u7684\\u98df\\u54c1\\u3002", "reviewed_by_human": false, "source_quote": "|  |\\n\\n| Drinks |\\n| Bottled soft drinks and fruit juice, cordials, cider, beer, wine (including sparkling wine) |\\n| Other liquids |\\n| Commercial preparations of lemon and lime juice, vinegar, grape juice |\\n| Fruits |\\n| Dried apricots, fruit bars |\\n| Commercial foods |\\n| Dried potatoes, gravies, sauces and fruit toppings, maraschino cherries, pickled onions, sauerkraut, pickles, maple syrup, jams, jellies, biscuits, bread, pie and pizza dough |\\n| Salads and fruit salads |\\n| Crustaceans |\\n| Meats |\\n| Delicatessen meats, mince meat, sausages |\\n| Other foods |\\n| Gelatin, coconut |\\n\\nOpen in a new tab\\n\\n\\\\\\n\\nDetailed information regarding foods containing sulphite additives can be found on the Australasian Society of Clinical Immunology and Allergy website () [...] In the early 1980s there were also a number of reports of asthma exacerbations and/or generalized skin reactions among asthmatic patients treated with bronchodilator medications containing sulphite (24, 31\\u201333). One report highlighted the case of a patient who was hypersensitive to metabisulphite and developed anaphylaxis following ingestion of metabisulphite-treated food (34). This patient had a prolonged clinical course, requiring two visits to the emergency department and three weeks of corticosteroid therapy, suggesting that the relapse and delayed recovery may have been related to continued exposure to sulphites during treatment."}]	允許使用	verified	["https://www.inchem.org/documents/jecfa/jeceval/jec_1986.htm", "https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/28019", "https://www.inchem.org/documents/jecfa/jecmono/40abcj16.htm"]
869	ADD-0065	硝酸鈉	Sodium Nitrate	["\\u667a\\u5229\\u785d\\u77f3", "\\u785d\\u9178\\u9209\\u9e7d"]	INS 251	["\\u4fdd\\u8272\\u5291"]	硝酸鈉是一種廣泛用於香腸及火腿製品的保色劑與防腐劑。它主要在肉製品、鮭魚卵及鱈魚卵加工中用以固定鮮紅色澤並抑制致命細菌生長。硝酸鹽本身毒性極低。國際安全評估表明，在規定限量下正常膳食攝取對人體無害，日常食用合規的肉製品，不會對人體產生危害，消費者可安心。	使用範圍及限量: 1.本品可使用於肉製品及魚肉製品；用量以NO2殘留量計為0.07 g/kg以下。         \n2.本品可使用於鮭魚卵製品及鱈魚卵製品；用量以NO2殘留量計為0.0050 g/kg以下。\n使用限制: 生鮮肉類、生鮮魚肉類及生鮮魚卵不得使用。	unknown	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	[]	允許使用	verified	["https://www.inchem.org/documents/jecfa/jeceval/jec_2163.htm", "https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/24268", "https://www.inchem.org/documents/jecfa/jecmono/v38aje06.htm"]
863	ADD-0059	亞硫酸氫鉀	Potassium Bisulfite	[]	INS 228	["\\u6f02\\u767d\\u5291"]	亞硫酸氫鉀在食品中主要作為抗氧化劑及漂白劑，廣泛應用於水果乾、釀造酒類、脫水蔬菜 and 薯類食品中，以保持食品原有色澤並延長保存期。由於它在食物中會釋放活性二氧化硫，對於患有氣喘或對亞硫酸鹽過敏的敏感族群，食用後可能引發呼吸道或皮膚過敏反應，此類族群應避免食用。	使用範圍及限量: 1.本品可使用於金針乾製品；用量以SO2殘留量計為4.0g/kg以下。 \n2.本品可用於杏乾；用量以SO2殘留量計為2.0 g/kg以下。 \n3.本品可使用於白葡萄乾；用量以SO2殘留量計為1.5 g/kg以下。 \n4.本品可使用於動物膠、脫水蔬菜及其他脫水水果；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.50 g/kg以下。 \n5.本品可使用於糖蜜及糖飴；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.30 g/kg以下。\n6.本品可使用於食用樹薯澱粉；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.15 g/kg以下。\n7.本品可使用於糖漬果實類、蝦類及貝類；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.10 g/kg以下。 \n8.本品可使用於蒟蒻：非直接供食用之蒟蒻原料，用量以SO2殘留量計為0.90 g/kg以下；直接供食用之蒟蒻製品，用量以SO2殘留量計為0.030 g/kg以下。\n9.本品可使用於上述食品以外之其他加工食品；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.030 g/kg以下。但飲料（不包括果汁）、麵粉及其製品（不包括烘焙食品）不得使用。	unknown	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	[{"group": "\\u6c23\\u5598\\u60a3\\u8005", "concern": "caution", "confidence": "research_supported", "source_type": "pubmed", "source_title": "Adverse reactions to the sulphite additives - PMC - NIH", "source_url": "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4017440", "source_year": "2022", "ai_reasoning": "\\u6587\\u737b\\u6307\\u51fa\\uff0c\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9e7d\\u7684\\u66b4\\u9732\\u4e3b\\u8981\\u6e90\\u65bc\\u98df\\u7528\\u542b\\u6709\\u9019\\u4e9b\\u6dfb\\u52a0\\u7269\\u7684\\u98df\\u54c1\\u548c\\u98f2\\u6599\\u3002\\u7814\\u7a76\\u986f\\u793a\\uff0c\\u7d04\\u67093%\\u81f310%\\u7684\\u6c23\\u5598\\u60a3\\u8005\\u5728\\u53e3\\u670d\\u651d\\u5165\\u9019\\u4e9b\\u6dfb\\u52a0\\u7269\\u5f8c\\u6703\\u5f15\\u767c\\u654f\\u611f\\u53cd\\u61c9\\u3002\\u5efa\\u8b70\\u6c23\\u5598\\u60a3\\u8005\\u61c9\\u907f\\u514d\\u98df\\u7528\\u542b\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9e7d\\u4e4b\\u98df\\u54c1\\u3002", "reviewed_by_human": false, "source_quote": "Exposure to the sulphites arises mainly from the consumption of foods and drinks that contain these additives; however exposure may also occur through the use of pharmaceutical products, as well as in occupational settings. Most studies report a prevalence of sulphite sensitivity of 3 to 10% among asthmatic subjects who ingest these additives."}, {"group": "\\u904e\\u654f\\u9ad4\\u8cea\\u8005", "concern": "caution", "confidence": "research_supported", "source_type": "pubmed", "source_title": "Adverse reactions to the sulphite additives - PMC - NIH", "source_url": "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4017440", "source_year": "2022", "ai_reasoning": "\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9e7d\\u662f\\u5e38\\u898b\\u7684\\u98df\\u7269\\u904e\\u654f\\u539f\\u3002\\u904e\\u654f\\u9ad4\\u8cea\\u8005\\u53e3\\u670d\\u651d\\u53d6\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u6c2b\\u9240\\u5f8c\\uff0c\\u53ef\\u80fd\\u5f15\\u767c\\u8541\\u9ebb\\u75b9\\u3001\\u76ae\\u819a\\u6f6e\\u7d05\\u3001\\u80c3\\u8178\\u9053\\u4e0d\\u9069\\u6216\\u904e\\u654f\\u6027\\u4f11\\u514b\\u7b49\\u56b4\\u91cd\\u904e\\u654f\\u53cd\\u61c9\\u3002\\u5efa\\u8b70\\u654f\\u611f\\u500b\\u9ad4\\u907f\\u514d\\u98df\\u7528\\u542b\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9e7d\\u7684\\u98df\\u54c1\\u3002", "reviewed_by_human": false, "source_quote": "|  |\\n\\n| Drinks |\\n| Bottled soft drinks and fruit juice, cordials, cider, beer, wine (including sparkling wine) |\\n| Other liquids |\\n| Commercial preparations of lemon and lime juice, vinegar, grape juice |\\n| Fruits |\\n| Dried apricots, fruit bars |\\n| Commercial foods |\\n| Dried potatoes, gravies, sauces and fruit toppings, maraschino cherries, pickled onions, sauerkraut, pickles, maple syrup, jams, jellies, biscuits, bread, pie and pizza dough |\\n| Salads and fruit salads |\\n| Crustaceans |\\n| Meats |\\n| Delicatessen meats, mince meat, sausages |\\n| Other foods |\\n| Gelatin, coconut |\\n\\nOpen in a new tab\\n\\n\\\\\\n\\nDetailed information regarding foods containing sulphite additives can be found on the Australasian Society of Clinical Immunology and Allergy website () [...] to hyperresponsiveness to SO2 gas, sulphite sensitivity predominantly refers to the triggering of adverse symptoms following ingestion, or parenteral or topical exposure to these additives. While sensitivity to the sulphites can present in a number of ways, it is the triggering of adverse respiratory symptoms (predominantly amongst asthmatics) that seems to occur most frequently. It has been estimated that 3\\u201310% of asthmatics experience such symptoms (7, 18, 19)."}]	允許使用	verified	["https://www.efsa.europa.eu", "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2406325", "https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/23663620"]
864	ADD-0060	偏亞硫酸氫鈉	Sodium Metabisulfite	["\\u7126\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9209"]	INS 223	["\\u6f02\\u767d\\u5291"]	偏亞硫酸氫鈉是一種常見的食品漂白劑與防霉劑。它廣泛添加於金針乾、杏乾、白葡萄乾、脫水蔬菜及澱粉中，用以保持食物良好外觀。在各國政府規定的安全限量內，正常膳食對人體是安全且無害的。不過，此成分會產生二氧化硫殘留，對亞硫酸鹽過敏的消費者或氣喘患者在食用前應多留意。	使用範圍及限量: 1.本品可使用於金針乾製品；用量以SO2殘留量計為4.0g/kg以下。 \n2.本品可用於杏乾；用量以SO2殘留量計為2.0 g/kg以下。 \n3.本品可使用於白葡萄乾；用量以SO2殘留量計為1.5 g/kg以下。 \n4.本品可使用於動物膠、脫水蔬菜及其他脫水水果；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.50 g/kg以下。 \n5.本品可使用於糖蜜及糖飴；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.30 g/kg以下。\n6.本品可使用於食用樹薯澱粉；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.15 g/kg以下。\n7.本品可使用於糖漬果實類、蝦類及貝類；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.10 g/kg以下。 \n8.本品可使用於蒟蒻：非直接供食用之蒟蒻原料，用量以SO2殘留量計為0.90 g/kg以下；直接供食用之蒟蒻製品，用量以SO2殘留量計為0.030 g/kg以下。\n9.本品可使用於上述食品以外之其他加工食品；用量以SO2殘留量計為0.030 g/kg以下。但飲料（不包括果汁）、麵粉及其製品（不包括烘焙食品）不得使用。	unknown	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	[{"group": "\\u6c23\\u5598\\u60a3\\u8005", "concern": "avoid", "confidence": "research_supported", "source_type": "pubmed", "source_title": "Adverse reactions to the sulphite additives - PMC - NIH", "source_url": "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4017440", "source_year": 1998, "ai_reasoning": "\\u6587\\u737b\\u6307\\u51fa\\uff0c\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9e7d\\u7684\\u66b4\\u9732\\u4e3b\\u8981\\u6e90\\u65bc\\u98df\\u7528\\u542b\\u6709\\u9019\\u4e9b\\u6dfb\\u52a0\\u7269\\u7684\\u98df\\u54c1\\u548c\\u98f2\\u6599\\u3002\\u7814\\u7a76\\u986f\\u793a\\uff0c\\u7d04\\u67093%\\u81f310%\\u7684\\u6c23\\u5598\\u60a3\\u8005\\u5728\\u53e3\\u670d\\u651d\\u5165\\u9019\\u4e9b\\u6dfb\\u52a0\\u7269\\u5f8c\\u6703\\u5f15\\u767c\\u654f\\u611f\\u53cd\\u61c9\\u3002\\u5efa\\u8b70\\u6c23\\u5598\\u60a3\\u8005\\u61c9\\u907f\\u514d\\u98df\\u7528\\u542b\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9e7d\\u4e4b\\u98df\\u54c1\\u3002", "reviewed_by_human": false, "source_quote": "Exposure to the sulphites arises mainly from the consumption of foods and drinks that contain these additives; however exposure may also occur through the use of pharmaceutical products, as well as in occupational settings. Most studies report a prevalence of sulphite sensitivity of 3 to 10% among asthmatic subjects who ingest these additives."}, {"group": "\\u904e\\u654f\\u9ad4\\u8cea\\u8005", "concern": "caution", "confidence": "research_supported", "source_type": "pubmed", "source_title": "[PDF] August 2019 Chapter 19: Undeclared Major Food Allerge - FDA", "source_url": "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4017440", "source_year": "2019", "ai_reasoning": "\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9e7d\\u662f\\u5e38\\u898b\\u7684\\u98df\\u7269\\u904e\\u654f\\u539f\\u3002\\u904e\\u654f\\u9ad4\\u8cea\\u8005\\u53e3\\u670d\\u651d\\u53d6\\u504f\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u6c2b\\u9209\\u5f8c\\uff0c\\u53ef\\u80fd\\u5f15\\u767c\\u8541\\u9ebb\\u75b9\\u3001\\u76ae\\u819a\\u6f6e\\u7d05\\u3001\\u80c3\\u8178\\u9053\\u4e0d\\u9069\\u6216\\u904e\\u654f\\u6027\\u4f11\\u514b\\u7b49\\u56b4\\u91cd\\u904e\\u654f\\u53cd\\u61c9\\u3002\\u5efa\\u8b70\\u654f\\u611f\\u500b\\u9ad4\\u907f\\u514d\\u98df\\u7528\\u542b\\u4e9e\\u786b\\u9178\\u9e7d\\u7684\\u98df\\u54c1\\u3002", "reviewed_by_human": false, "source_quote": "One of the earliest reports suggesting that ingestion of sulphites could cause irritation of the respiratory tract was published in 1973 (5). Since then numerous case reports and reviews have been published on the phenomenon of respiratory hypersensitivity to ingested sulphites. The first case of anaphylaxis following ingestion of sodium metabisulphite in a restaurant salad was reported in 1976 (6), and the following year SO2 in orange drinks was reported to induce asthma (15)."}]	允許使用	verified	["https://www.inchem.org/documents/jecfa/jeceval/jec_2159.htm", "https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/656671", "https://www.inchem.org/documents/jecfa/jecmono/40abcj16.htm"]
865	ADD-0061	過氧化苯甲醯	Benzoyl Peroxide	["\\u904e\\u6c27\\u5316\\u82ef\\u7532\\u9170"]	INS 928	["\\u6f02\\u767d\\u5291"]	過氧化苯甲醯是一種用於乾酪及乳清加工的漂白與麵粉處理劑。它主要在起司、牛奶及乾酪的製造過程中作為殺菌與改善質地使用。此成分具有強氧化性，但在最終產品中的用量極微且會被還原。國際安全評估指出，在規定的安全限量內正常食用，其殘留對消費者健康無害，大眾不需擔心。	使用範圍及限量: 1.\t本品可於乳清之加工過程中視實際需要適量使用。 \n2.\t本品可使用於乾酪之加工；用量為20mg/kg以下（以牛奶重計）。	unknown	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	[]	允許使用	verified	["https://www.inchem.org/documents/jecfa/jeceval/jec_191.htm", "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/38453786", "https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/7187"]
866	ADD-0062	亞硝酸鉀	Potassium Nitrite	["\\u4e9e\\u785d\\u9178\\u9240\\u9e7d"]	INS 249	["\\u4fdd\\u8272\\u5291"]	亞硝酸鉀主要作為肉製品與魚類食品的保色劑及防腐劑，能賦予火腿、培根等加工肉品美觀的紅潤色澤，並有效抑制致命的肉毒桿菌生長。然而，過量攝取亞硝酸鹽會影響血液攜氧能力，尤其是三個月以下的嬰幼兒因身體機能未成熟，應嚴格禁止食用含此添加物的食品，一般兒童也應適量食用。	使用範圍及限量: 1.本品可使用於肉製品及魚肉製品；用量以NO2殘留量計為0.07 g/kg以下。         \n2.本品可使用於鮭魚卵製品及鱈魚卵製品；用量以NO2殘留量計為0.0050 g/kg以下。\n使用限制: 生鮮肉類、生鮮魚肉類及生鮮魚卵不得使用。	unknown	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	[{"group": "\\u5b30\\u5e7c\\u5152", "concern": "danger", "confidence": "verified", "source_type": "official", "source_title": "Safety of General Food Additives: Nitrites (JECFA / WHO)", "source_url": "https://www.who.int", "source_year": "2017", "ai_reasoning": "\\u4e9e\\u785d\\u9178\\u9e7d\\u6703\\u8207\\u8840\\u7d05\\u7d20\\u7d50\\u5408\\uff0c\\u5c0e\\u81f4\\u9ad8\\u9435\\u8840\\u7d05\\u7d20\\u8840\\u75c7\\uff0c\\u4f7f\\u8840\\u6db2\\u651c\\u6c27\\u80fd\\u529b\\u4e0b\\u964d\\u30023\\u500b\\u6708\\u4ee5\\u4e0b\\u5b30\\u5e7c\\u5152\\u56e0\\u9ad4\\u5167\\u9ad8\\u9435\\u8840\\u7d05\\u7d20\\u9084\\u539f\\u9176\\u6d3b\\u6027\\u8f03\\u4f4e\\uff0c\\u5c0d\\u4e9e\\u785d\\u9178\\u9e7d\\u6975\\u5ea6\\u654f\\u611f\\uff0c\\u56e0\\u6b64\\u56b4\\u7981\\u6dfb\\u52a0\\u65bc\\u8a72\\u5e74\\u9f61\\u5c64\\u4e4b\\u98df\\u54c1\\u4e2d\\u3002", "reviewed_by_human": false}, {"group": "\\u5152\\u7ae5", "concern": "caution", "confidence": "verified", "source_type": "official", "source_title": "Re-evaluation of potassium nitrite (E 249) and sodium nitrite (E 250) as food additives", "source_url": "https://www.efsa.europa.eu", "source_year": "2017", "ai_reasoning": "\\u6839\\u64daEFSA\\u8a55\\u4f30\\uff0c\\u5728\\u542b\\u4e9e\\u785d\\u9178\\u9240\\u4e4b\\u52a0\\u5de5\\u98df\\u54c1\\u651d\\u53d6\\u91cf\\u8f03\\u9ad8\\u6642\\uff0c\\u5152\\u7ae5\\u8207\\u9752\\u5c11\\u5e74\\u7684\\u65e5\\u81b3\\u98df\\u66b4\\u9732\\u91cf\\u53ef\\u80fd\\u6703\\u8d85\\u51fa\\u6bcf\\u65e5\\u5141\\u8a31\\u651d\\u53d6\\u91cf\\uff0c\\u53ef\\u80fd\\u5e36\\u4f86\\u5065\\u5eb7\\u98a8\\u96aa\\uff0c\\u9700\\u63a7\\u5236\\u651d\\u53d6\\u7e3d\\u91cf\\u3002", "reviewed_by_human": false}]	允許使用	verified	["https://www.who.int", "https://www.efsa.europa.eu", "https://www.inchem.org/documents/jecfa/jeceval/jec_1988.htm", "https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/516910", "https://www.inchem.org/documents/jecfa/jecmono/v38aje07.htm"]
867	ADD-0063	亞硝酸鈉	Sodium Nitrite	["\\u4e9e\\u785d\\u9178\\u9209\\u9e7d"]	INS 250	["\\u4fdd\\u8272\\u5291"]	亞硝酸鈉是一種常用於肉品加工的保色劑與防腐劑。它廣泛添加於香腸、培根、貢丸等肉製品中，主要用於保持外觀紅潤並抑制細菌繁殖。儘管過量攝取有健康風險，但合理限量下使用非常安全，且能防範肉毒桿菌中毒。法規明文禁止使用於生鮮食材中，消費者應適量食用各類加工肉品。	使用範圍及限量: 1.本品可使用於肉製品及魚肉製品；用量以NO2殘留量計為0.07 g/kg以下。         \n2.本品可使用於鮭魚卵製品及鱈魚卵製品；用量以NO2殘留量計為0.0050 g/kg以下。\n使用限制: 生鮮肉類、生鮮魚肉類及生鮮魚卵不得使用。	unknown	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	[]	允許使用	verified	["https://www.inchem.org/documents/jecfa/jeceval/jec_2164.htm", "https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/23668193"]
868	ADD-0064	硝酸鉀	Potassium Nitrate	["\\u785d\\u77f3", "\\u785d\\u9178\\u9240\\u9e7d"]	INS 252	["\\u4fdd\\u8272\\u5291"]	硝酸鉀是一種常用於肉類及魚類製品的保色劑。它主要添加於培根、火腿及鮭魚卵製品中，以維持食品的良好外觀並防止肉毒桿菌生長。此成分進入體內會部分轉化為亞硝酸鹽。經國際食品安全機構與官方安全評估，在規定的限量標準內，日常飲食正常膳食攝取非常安全，消費者不需過度擔憂。	使用範圍及限量: 1.本品可使用於肉製品及魚肉製品；用量以NO2殘留量計為0.07 g/kg以下。         \n2.本品可使用於鮭魚卵製品及鱈魚卵製品；用量以NO2殘留量計為0.0050 g/kg以下。\n使用限制: 生鮮肉類、生鮮魚肉類及生鮮魚卵不得使用。	unknown	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	[]	允許使用	verified	["https://www.inchem.org/documents/jecfa/jeceval/jec_1987.htm", "https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/24434"]
870	ADD-0066	鉀明礬	Potassium Alum	["\\u660e\\u792c", "\\u786b\\u9178\\u92c1\\u9240"]	INS 522	["\\u81a8\\u8139\\u5291"]	鉀明礬（硫酸鋁鉀）是一種傳統的食品膨脹劑。它主要添加於油條、粉圓、烘焙糕餅及醃漬蔬菜中，用以增加酥脆度或蓬鬆口感。由於過量鋁可能對神經系統產生不良影響，國際安全機構對鋁的攝取量設有警示。在法規標準內適量食用對人體安全無礙，但建議日常飲食應減少過度依賴明礬類食品。	使用範圍及限量: 本品可於各類食品中視實際需要適量使用\n使用限制: 限於食品製造或加工必須時使用。	unknown	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	[]	允許使用	research_supported	["https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/24856"]
871	ADD-0067	鈉明礬	Sodium Alum	[]	INS 521	["\\u81a8\\u8139\\u5291"]	鈉明礬（硫酸鋁鈉）是一種常用的烘焙用膨脹劑。它主要添加於麵包、蛋糕、油條和粉圓中，能使糕餅口感蓬鬆與外觀飽滿。因成分含有鋁，國際食品安全機構對鋁鹽定有每週安全攝取限量，以保障健康。在法規的安全限制內正常食用非常安全，但日常膳食中建議適量，避免偏食單一類蓬鬆食品。	使用範圍及限量: 本品可於各類食品中視實際需要適量使用。\n使用限制: 限於食品製造或加工必須時使用。	unknown	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	[]	允許使用	research_supported	["https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/24568"]
